[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:04.78]left a single note and went on their way
[00:10.26]I never got their name until the credits
[00:14.74]now it plays here every single day
[00:20.66]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:23.02]One note at a time
[00:29.86]from people passing through
[00:33.72]a name beside a line
[00:39.38]and part of it is you
[00:45.20]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
